        "## Task 2: The Age Calculator\n",
        "\n",
        "**Objective:** Practice `input()`, `int()`, and subtraction (`-`).\n",
        "\n",
        "**Task:**\n",
        "1. Ask the user to enter the current year.\n",
        "2. Ask the user to enter their birth year.\n",
        "3. Convert both inputs to integers.\n",
        "4. Calculate and print their age.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Example Output:**\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Enter the current year: 2026\n",
        "Enter your birth year: 2005\n",
        "Your age is: 21\n",
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "3DXsb62H5xXL"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# 1. Ask the user to enter the current year.\n",
        "current_year = input(\"Enter the current year: \")\n",
        "\n",
        "# 2. Ask the user to enter their birth year.\n",
        "birth_year = input(\"Enter your birth year: \")\n",
        "\n",
        "# 3. Convert both inputs to integers.\n",
        "current_year = int(current_year)\n",
        "birth_year = int(birth_year)\n",
        "\n",
        "# 4. Calculate and print their age.\n",
        "age = current_year - birth_year\n",
        "print(f\"Your age is: {age}\")"
