        "## Task 3: Simple Shopping Calculator\n",
        "\n",
        "**Objective:** Practice `float()`, `int()`, multiplication (`*`), and addition (`+`).\n",
        "\n",
        "**Task:**\n",
        "1. Ask the user to enter the price of one item.\n",
        "2. Ask the user to enter the quantity.\n",
        "3. Convert the price to `float` and the quantity to `int`.\n",
        "4. Calculate the total bill.\n",
        "5. Print the total bill.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Example Output:**\n",
        "```text\n",
        "Enter item price: 10.5\n",
        "Enter quantity: 3\n",
        "Total bill: 31.5\n",
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "q-zYW-xL5xXM"
